<!-- 扫描遗迹任务（QuestScriptDef）。键按 rulesStrings 列表序号编号，定稿后可直接并入 DefInjected/QuestScriptDef/。
     两点说明：
     1. 任务名规则（questNameRules）在抽象基类 RealRuins_ScannedRuinsBase 里，DefInjected 无法翻译抽象 def，
        需要时我可以用 PatchOperation 做翻译补丁（草稿见文件末尾注释）。
     2. 任务过期信件的 label/text 带 TKey="LetterLabelQuestExpired"/"LetterTextQuestExpired"，
        指向原版键，Core 语言包已有翻译，无需处理。 -->
<LanguageData>

  <!-- ===== RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records（翻查档案） ===== -->

  <!-- EN: [scannerName] spent days at the [scanBuilding] going through [sources], and finally [clue]. Checked against old maps, it all points to one spot, a group of ancient buildings, very old and abandoned, but with doors still sealed and all inventory and machinery still inside.\n\nUnfortunately, those sources were never yours alone. [leak] All nearby settlements are already preparing to fight for whatever lies inside these ruins. The treasure could be enormous, so be prepared for a real massacre, not like the usual carefully balanced encounters you've had before. And don't waste time, scavengers are already on their way, and the ruins won't last long. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>questDescription-&gt;[scannerName]在[scanBuilding]花了几天翻查[sources]，终于[clue]。对照旧地图一一核实后，所有线索都指向同一个地点：一群远古建筑，年代久远、早已被遗弃，但大门仍然紧闭，里面的物资和机械原封未动。\n\n可惜，这些档案从来不是只有我们知道。[leak]附近所有聚落都已经准备为遗迹里的东西大打出手。宝藏可能极其可观，做好准备迎接一场真正的屠杀吧，这可不像你以往遇到的那些经过精心平衡的遭遇战。别浪费时间，拾荒者已经在路上，遗迹撑不了多久。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!-- EN: a crate of water-damaged books from before the collapse -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>sources-&gt;一箱坍塌时代之前的受潮书籍</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!-- EN: old survey records bought from a trader for a handful of silver -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>sources-&gt;用几块白银从商人手里买来的旧勘测记录</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!-- EN: the journals of a long-dead exploration party -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>sources-&gt;一支早已死绝的探险队留下的日志</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!-- EN: a dozen folk tales that contradict each other in every detail but one -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>sources-&gt;十二则除了一点之外处处互相矛盾的民间传说</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!-- EN: the ledgers of a trading company that no longer exists -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>sources-&gt;一家早已不存在的贸易公司的账册</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!-- EN: found the same unmarked depot mentioned in three unrelated sources -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>clue-&gt;在三个互不相关的来源里发现了同一个无标记仓库</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!-- EN: noticed that an old supply route ends at a place no map bothers to name -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>clue-&gt;注意到一条旧补给路线的终点在任何地图上都没有名字</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!-- EN: matched a hand-drawn sketch in a margin to the shape of a nearby valley -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>clue-&gt;把页边的手绘草图和附近一座山谷的形状对上了号</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!-- EN: decoded a quartermaster's notes about a stockpile that was never collected -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>clue-&gt;破译了一批军需官的笔记，里面提到一笔从未被提取的储备物资</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>
  <!-- EN: Other settlements keep copies of the same books, and someone else was reading them at the same time. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>leak-&gt;其他聚落也留着同样的书，而且当时正好也有别人在读。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!-- EN: The trader who sold you the records had sold the same bundle to every settlement around. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>leak-&gt;卖给你档案的商人把同一批货卖给了周围每一个聚落。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!-- EN: Asking passing caravans about old landmarks was a mistake, they put two and two together faster than you did. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>leak-&gt;向路过的远行队打听旧地标是个错误，他们比你更快反应了过来。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>
  <!-- EN: The scouts you sent to confirm the location were seen, and followed. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.13>leak-&gt;你派去确认位置的侦察兵暴露了行踪，而且被人跟上了。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.13>

  <!-- ===== RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio（无线电定位） ===== -->

  <!-- EN: After days of [listening] at the [scanBuilding], [scannerName] finally picked out [signal]. Triangulation points to a group of ancient buildings. The complex is very old and abandoned, but its doors are still sealed and all inventory and machinery is still inside.\n\nUnfortunately, you weren't the only ones listening. [leak] All nearby settlements are already preparing to fight for whatever lies inside these ruins. The treasure could be enormous, so be prepared for a real massacre, not like the usual carefully balanced encounters you've had before. And don't waste time, scavengers are already on their way, and the ruins won't last long. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>questDescription-&gt;在[scanBuilding]连续[listening]数日之后，[scannerName]终于捕捉到了[signal]。三角定位指向一群远古建筑。建筑群年代久远、早已被遗弃，但大门仍然紧闭，里面的物资和机械原封未动。\n\n可惜，听到的不止你们。[leak]附近所有聚落都已经准备为遗迹里的东西大打出手。宝藏可能极其可观，做好准备迎接一场真正的屠杀吧，这可不像你以往遇到的那些经过精心平衡的遭遇战。别浪费时间，拾荒者已经在路上，遗迹撑不了多久。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!-- EN: sweeping old frequencies -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>listening-&gt;扫过旧频段</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!-- EN: pinging long-silent transponder codes -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>listening-&gt;呼叫早已沉寂的应答器代码</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!-- EN: hacking into a derelict satellite relay -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>listening-&gt;入侵一座废弃的卫星中继站</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!-- EN: triangulating stray transmissions -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>listening-&gt;对零散的信号发射进行三角定位</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!-- EN: a faint automated beacon repeating the same distress code it has been sending for centuries -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>signal-&gt;一个微弱的自动信标，几百年来一直在重复同一段求救代码</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!-- EN: a cluster of shielded power signatures where there should be nothing at all -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>signal-&gt;本应空无一物的地方出现了一簇被屏蔽的能源信号</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!-- EN: a dormant security network quietly answering each of your pings -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>signal-&gt;一个休眠的安防网络在悄悄应答你的每一次呼叫</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!-- EN: an encrypted maintenance channel that finally cracked open on the hundredth try -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>signal-&gt;一条加密的维护频道在第一百次尝试时终于被破解</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!-- EN: Your active pings woke up the complex's own beacon, and it is now broadcasting its position on every band. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>leak-&gt;你主动发射的信号唤醒了建筑群自己的信标，它现在正在所有频段上广播自己的位置。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>
  <!-- EN: Your triangulation pings were loud enough for every comms array in the region to trace them to the same spot. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>leak-&gt;你的三角定位信号足够响亮，该地区的每一座通讯阵列都能据此找到同一个位置。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!-- EN: A passing trader intercepted your comms traffic and is selling the coordinates to anyone willing to pay. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>leak-&gt;一名路过的商人截获了你们的通讯内容，正在向任何愿意付钱的人出售坐标。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!-- EN: The moment you narrowed it down, the old security network started answering everyone, not just you. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>leak-&gt;你们刚锁定位置，旧安防网络就开始应答所有人，而不只是你们。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>

